    "After publication, clear logical duplicate edges before capacity donation. Require current context, Active lifecycle and empty callee packet; retain a larger existing arena. Empty retained capacity must neither retain weak arguments nor become a hidden Lua root.",
    "Preserve nil/tuple cardinality, actual tail-hook local mutation, collected retired weak arguments, error identity, yielding callees and close/error roots. Native/metamethod/migration tails retain their separate copy/continuation protocols.",
    "Keep bounded work charged before moving/clearing; genuine larger-callee refusal, original error status and healthy retry remain mandatory actual witnesses. Source inspection and an enabled allocator control are not evidence that a refusal occurred.",
